  {
    "id": "1247173",
    "original": "色々並行してやってるから芥川ばかり読んでるのでもないのだよ。今は英語読んでる時間が増えてる。ドイツ語も毎日少しずつやってる。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1338771",
        "text": "I do a lot in parallel, therefore I do not only read Akutagawa. At the moment, I am reading more and more in English. I am also reading a bit in German every day."
